<title>AUSTRALIA: St George will cut key mortgage rate.</title>
<headline>St George will cut key mortgage rate.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>St George Bank Ltd said on Wednesday it would reduce its standard variable mortgage rate by 65 basis points to 8.75 percent, matching the new rate of the nation's four major banks.</p>
<p>St George, a regional bank based in Sydney, said its reduction was in response to the monetary policy easing announced by the Reserve Bank earlier in the day and would take effect on January 1 next year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
